    <briefdescription>
<para>Semantic PathConstraints tests — SC-01..SC-10. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Tests cover: SC-01 addSemanticConstraint attaches ontology (API smoke test) SC-02 validateSemanticPath with no graph_mgr returns empty violations SC-03 OntologyManager::isEdgeTypeAllowed — valid edge accepted SC-04 OntologyManager::isEdgeTypeAllowed — invalid edge type rejected SC-05 STRICT vs WARN ruleset modes stored correctly SC-06 lastViolations() reflects the last validateSemanticPath call SC-07 isEdgeTypeAllowed unknown source class → true (graceful degradation) SC-08 isEdgeTypeAllowed unknown target class → true (graceful degradation) SC-09 allowedEdgeTypes empty when no axioms restrict source/target pair SC-10 PathConstraints clearConstraints preserves semantic state </para>
    </detaileddescription>
